---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, trunc(_score, 3) as _score FROM text_search(qs, 'secondary') where subject!='math' order by _score desc LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Projection: text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary")).id, text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary")).answer, trunc(text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"))._score, Int64(3)) AS _score                                             |
|               |     Filter: text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary")).subject != Utf8("math")                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       Projection: text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"))._score, text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary")).answer, text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary")).id, text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary")).subject                        |
|               |         SearchTelemetry                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: text_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"))                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |             Projection: search_index._score, base_table.answer, search_index.id, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                         |
|               |               Sort: search_index._score DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 Projection: search_index.id, search_index._score, base_table.answer, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                     |
|               |                   Left Join: search_index.id = base_table.id                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                     SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                       SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                         TableScan: full_text                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                     Projection: base_table.answer, base_table.id, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                        |
|               |                       TableScan: base_table projection=[answer, id, question, reference_answer, source, subject]                                                                                                 |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@2 DESC], fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@2 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                    |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as id, answer@1 as answer, trunc(_score@0, 3) as _score]                                                                                                                          |
|               |       FilterExec: subject@3 != math, projection=[_score@0, answer@1, id@2]                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@0 as _score, answer@1 as answer, id@2 as id, subject@6 as subject]                                                                                                          |
|               |           SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                 |
|               |               ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@1 as _score, answer@2 as answer, id@0 as id, question@3 as question, reference_answer@4 as reference_answer, source@5 as source, subject@6 as subject]                |
|               |                 HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, _score@1, answer@2, question@4, reference_answer@5, source@6, subject@7] |
|               |                   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                       FullTextSearchTableExec q=secondary                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                       DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[2]                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
